Decoder for the enhancement layer of Dolby Vision profile 7.

Adds --vd-lavc-dovi-fel. With VA-API, a second decoder of CB1 decodes the
enhancement layer units inside the packets of the base layer. Each base
layer picture waits until its enhancement layer picture of the same
timestamp is decoded, and then carries it in mp_image.dovi_el. The
Matroska demuxer passes the hvcE configuration of the enhancement layer
to the decoder.

A profile 7 MEL stream can come without enhancement layer pictures. If a
base layer picture has its own RPU, and the RPU shows that the picture
needs no residual, the picture plays without an enhancement layer
picture.

